  "name": "cli-observability-flow-blockers",
  "title": "Fix Koala CLI observability and lifecycle blocker regressions",
  "description": "Fix three high-value Koala workflow regressions from user feedback: invalid JSON/schema enum arguments silently fall back to help instead of showing validation errors, Koala-generated init-self-check.json blocks DONE cleanup as an untracked non-whitelisted file, and dispatch calls do not write auditable process-events even though channel review expects dispatch evidence. These issues create false green signals, repeated DONE blockers, and audit-chain mismatches.",
